      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUMMER FAITH (1) goes very well over this track and trip including two wins. Comes off a (20.09) win last time, scoring by 1.75 lengths in a Mix 3/4 over 350m at this track. Expected to go close. CASH DE ORO (3) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 5 lengths at this track in a handy 20.10 beating Scott Enigma. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. ROYAL BANDIT (4) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey here having won two of four starts. Missed the frame latest (30.25) when seventh over 520m at Wentworth Park in a Grade 4/5. Among the main chances. PAW VERA (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
